# Fingerprints of the three instruction texts.
# These are SHA-256 checksums of the file contents. They prove the instructions in this
# repository are byte-for-byte the ones given to the models during the runs.
# Verify with:  shasum -a 256 -c FINGERPRINTS.sha256
